{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\"><onentry><send target=\"#_internal\"/></onentry><transition event=\"go\" target=\"f\"/></state><final id=\"f\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml052-send-without-event.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml052-send-without-event.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":147,"endColumn":51,"endLine":2,"startColumn":51,"startLine":2},"insertedContent":{"text":" event=\"…\""}}]}],"description":{"text":"add the `event` to deliver"},"properties":{"applicability":"has-placeholders"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml052-send-without-event.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":31,"endLine":2,"startColumn":27,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<send>` to the SCXML event processor names no event\n\n**Note:** the SCXML Event I/O Processor delivers a named event, so a `<send>` it handles must have `event` or `eventexpr`; without them the send raises `error.execution` instead of delivering anything\n\n**Help:** add `event=\"name\"` with the event to deliver, or `eventexpr` to compute it\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §6.2 <send>\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §C.1 SCXML Event I/O Processor","text":"`<send>` to the SCXML event processor names no event"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":127,"start":123},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML052"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"the SCXML Event I/O Processor (the default `<send>` type) delivers a named event, so SCXML 1.0 §6.2 requires `event` or `eventexpr` for it; without one the send raises `error.execution` and delivers nothing"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: add `event=\"name\"` (or `eventexpr`) naming the event to deliver; a different `type` has its own requirements.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §6.2 <send>\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML052` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#send","id":"SCXML052","name":"SCXML052","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a `<send>` to the SCXML event processor names no event"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}